1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:01,329
(Amy:)Then people sit

2
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:02,733
(Amy:)on opposite sides of the table

3
00:00:02,735 --> 00:00:04,765
(Amy:)and try to blow the wool off.

4
00:00:07,239 --> 00:00:10,479
(Dr Koothrappali:)Sorry.
She's taken, too.

5
00:00:12,845 --> 00:00:14,475
(Howard:)You know what I think
your problem is?

6
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,480
(Howard:)You're jealous

7
00:00:15,481 --> 00:00:17,351
(Howard:)because you and I
used to be

8
00:00:17,349 --> 00:00:19,979
(Howard:)best friends until
Koothrappali came along.

9
00:00:19,985 --> 00:00:22,385
(Leonard:)And you found somebody
you could push around?

10
00:00:22,388 --> 00:00:23,518
Hey!
Stay out of this.

11
00:00:23,522 --> 00:00:26,422
(Leonard:)Okay.

12
00:00:26,425 --> 00:00:28,525
(Howard:)You know, maybe I'm
best friends with Raj

13
00:00:28,527 --> 00:00:30,557
(Howard:)because he doesn't think
he's smarter than me.

14
00:00:30,563 --> 00:00:32,933
(Raj:)Actually...
I said, stay out of it!

15
00:00:32,932 --> 00:00:35,532
N-No. No, Raj, go ahead,
say what you were gonna say.

16
00:00:35,534 --> 00:00:36,934
(Raj:)All I'm gonna say is

17
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:38,936
(Raj:)you guys need
to stop this right now.

18
00:00:38,938 --> 00:00:41,368
It-It's bad enough that
my parents are fighting,

19
00:00:41,373 --> 00:00:43,503
(Raj:)now I have to hear
the two of you?

20
00:00:43,509 --> 00:00:44,679
(Raj:)And who cares who's smarter?

21
00:00:44,677 --> 00:00:46,407
(Raj:)If it's Leonard or me or...

22
00:00:46,412 --> 00:00:48,742
(Raj:)you know, it's Christmas,
let's say it's Howard.

23
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:54,984
(Howard:)Well, if you're so smart,
you get the bird out.

24
00:00:54,987 --> 00:00:56,217
(Raj:)No, you're the one
who let him in.

25
00:00:56,221 --> 00:00:58,321
(Howard:)How do you know
it wasn't Leonard?

